      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766237669237,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果是fork()创建子进程之后\n子进程程序替换呢？？？\n对父进程有影响吗？？？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果是fork()创建子进程之后\n子进程程序替换呢？？？\n对父进程有影响吗？？？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
