      "seed": 1786355749,
      "version": 256,
      "versionNonce": 229864907,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766231666878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "李四要跟张三出去玩，在张三楼下等他\n每隔几分钟询问他是否已经下楼了。\n在每次打电话间隔期间他可以做一下\n自己的事情",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "李四要跟张三出去玩，在张三楼下等他\n每隔几分钟询问他是否已经下楼了。\n在每次打电话间隔期间他可以做一下\n自己的事情",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1B2MbImkj-8hNCAB7T1KE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1045.2002220153809,
      "y": 91.20003890991211,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1350436325,
      "version": 535,
      "versionNonce": 306195301,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766231765646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "李四又要跟张三出去玩，在张三楼下等他\n上次实在是等太久了，这次他打了一次电话。\n一直不挂，直到张三下楼，这个期间他就\n啥事也干不了",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "李四又要跟张三出去玩，在张三楼下等他\n上次实在是等太久了，这次他打了一次电话。\n一直不挂，直到张三下楼，这个期间他就\n啥事也干不了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
